[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-SRS010
TITLE: Request pattern entry and landing, and read back runway and landing
STATEMENT: >>>
The aircraft shall request pattern entry for the configured pattern side and runway, and shall request landing with its current position. A runway assignment and a cleared-to-land clearance for this runway shall be read back with the runway and the call sign last. The aircraft shall not descend to the surface on final until a landing clearance or another landing-type clearance is accepted. Acceptance is the pattern-entry phrase from the ramp and the readback Cleared to land runway two seven followed by the call sign.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Landing is a separate acceptance from merely flying the pattern.
<<<
DAL: E
